window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Finally, all three books in the Unexpected trilogy are available with one click! You'll get Tomer and Lettie's entire love story in this collection: <i>Unexpected Hero</i>, <i>Unexpected Heroine</i>, and <i>Unexpected Redemption</i>. Over 52 hours for one Audible credit, all narrated by Aaron Shedlock and Kelsey Navarro Foster.</p> <p>This is a spicy, age gap, forbidden romantic suspense three-book series featuring a former military intelligence officer turned security specialist who falls for his boss's secret daughter while covertly \"observing\" her. It's hot, swoony, suspenseful, angsty, and even has some laughs. Check content warnings on the author's website.</p> <p>This trilogy is part of the larger Redleg Security Series; however, it can be listened to on its own. The Redleg Security series begins with <i>Heartbreak Hero</i> if you wish to start at the beginning.</p> <p>About Book 1: <i>Unexpected Hero</i>:<i> </i>Five Steps to Covertly Protecting My Boss’s Secret Daughter by Tomer Stillman, a hacker and secret Dom with a psych eval full of red flags. Fortunately, nobody cares to notice.</p> <ol> <li>Get her a safe job and place to live.</li> <li>Make sure she has plenty of food.</li> <li>Protect her from her overly-trusting self, even if that means crossing lines.</li> <li>Daily checks of her location, phone, and devices for suspicious activity, following her when necessary.</li> <li>Fulfill all her sexual desires.</li> </ol> <p>No. Scratch that last one. Not only because she’s too young and inexperienced. But because I need to keep my distance. The more I watch her, the more the lines blur between protection and obsession. I never intended to come face to face with her, but in a moment of weakness, I intervened. And it changed everything.</p> <p>She makes me feel things. Things I’m not ready to feel. I never thought I had a heart, but the more I'm with her, the faster it beats. Now, I’m left wondering, will she forgive me for the things I’ve done to protect her? Or will the only woman I’ve ever cared for leave me like everyone else?</p>"; 
